                <head>Arrangement between the United States and France with respect to air
                    navigation, effected by exchange of notes, signed July 15, 1939</head>
                <p>[This agreement was the culmination of negotiations following the submission of
                    draft arrangements transmitted by the Department of State to the Embassy in
                    France with instruction No. 1517, January 24, 1933. Correspondence regarding
                    negotiations carried on intermittently during the following years is not
                    printed. For texts of notes exchanged July 15, 1939, see Department of State
                    Executive Agreement Series No. 152, or 53 Stat. 2408.]</p>
            </div>
